Hi! This is small update that cleans bugs after the last major update. Also for those who find the game too hard or too easy - you can change the difficulty in the options of the main menu.

- Fixed bug with crash game on "ENG ENG" spell;
- Added levels of difficulty in Options Menu;
- Fixed some minor bugs.

Mini update. There'll be more soon!

- The time limit during the fear effect has been increased;
- Fixed "33 food" achievement (now working);
- Shields and other effects now disappear when a character dies;
- After the death of a character, you can't click on the character;
- Information about the characters in battle is now more clearly visible.

After the release I got some more very useful feedback, based on which I made some small updates.

[b]List of changes:[/b]
- The normal difficulty mode now shows you the walls in the dungeon, making it easier to navigate;
- Cell with boss now has a special icon, after its exploration;
- When selecting a hero, you can now see his basic attack power;
- Fixed a lot of buggies (really a lot).

In future updates I will try to add more hints in the control and explanation of the mechanic of the game.

New game mode "[b]Dark Forest[/b]' and new boss and hero — Witch.
